# Browser targets for the web client's LEGACY (ES5) build only.
# This file is read exclusively by legacy/build-legacy.mjs and fed to @babel/preset-env and
# autoprefixer. It lives here rather than at the package root so it can never influence the modern
# esbuild build, which targets browsers that run the module bundle.
# The floor itself is issue #824's and is kept identical to ../../runtime/.browserslistrc.
# 4.4 rather than 4.0: the Android 4.0-4.3 stock browser has no WebSocket, and the deck talks to
# the host over one, so it could never connect there whatever the bundle and the stylesheet did
# (issue #829).
ios >= 9
safari >= 9
android >= 4.4
chrome >= 30
firefox >= 30
